{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださりありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46四期生の勝又春です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここ最近、ぐっと冷え込む日が増えてきましたね❄︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミニホットカーペットと、生姜スープおすすめです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、寒さは自律神経のバランスにも影響するそうで、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "身体を温めるのはもちろん、朝日を浴びたり、深呼吸をしたりして、心身をリラックスさせることも大切です✏️🙂‍↕️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "急に授業を始めてしまいましたが、\n身体はもちろん、心もほっとゆるめる時間も大切にしてください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "というのがこの授業の結論です📚"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は、好きなことを考えたり、楽しみな予定を思い浮かべたりしている時間がそれに当てはまると思っていて、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "つまり、皆さんとお話ししたり、レターを読んだりしている時！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんからいただく言葉に、いつも心をあたためてもらっています☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めていつもありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "逆に、皆さんにとっても、私とお話ししたり、私のことを考えたりする時間が、心をゆるめられるひとときになっていたら嬉しいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ということで、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobCsl5N5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は私のこと、考えてくれますか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「寒い日も春のようなあたたかさを届ける」というのが、私の名前の由来なので\n張り切ってあたためますね笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobCdF1aA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "勝又 春　#62"}], "source": "official"}